   3.997459102717989*^9, 3.997459105588698*^9}, 3.997460463856427*^9, {
   3.997476409689303*^9, 
   3.9974764100161057`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"76a2b1d1-f181-43b3-8769-\
3845747cc0ef"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-MATH-486 test suite validates the core computational logic of the \
GWP1D486 parameter engine. Utilizing the previously verified extractor \
functions, the suite evaluates the engine\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ability to \
correctly parse complex inputs and construct the fundamental parameter bus. \
It systematically proves that the engine accurately derives the necessary \
real-valued parameters\[LongDash]such as the translated position, momentum, \
phase components, and normalization constant\[LongDash]while strictly \
preserving foundational constants like mass, Planck\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
constant, potential coefficients, and the initial input variables.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996754869208313*^9, {3.9974611805853167`*^9, 3.997461183676579*^9}, {
   4.000409992745369*^9, 4.000409996353079*^9}, {4.000410477815854*^9, 
   4.000410478425661*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"923886c8-ad1b-4949-a41d-\
5c04ed7a5d42"],

